    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Forearm healed; no other skin infections</td></tr><tr><td>Allergic and immunologic</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vaccine, egg or gelatin allergy; no immune disorder</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>3 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

